      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They say that place is crawling with\r\nterrifying monsters! The fact that you\r\nwere told about it proves how strong\r\nyou are, Master Arisen!",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、あそこは怖い魔物が\r\nうようよしてるんですって！\r\nそんな場所を教えられるなんて\r\n覚者さまがお強い証拠ですね！"
