      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Good luck with your gathering!\r\nAnd when you return to Megado,\r\nbe sure to rest at our inn!",
        "Jp" : "採取、頑張ってくださいねぇ！\r\nそして、メガドにお戻りになられた際の\r\nご休憩はぜひうちの宿で！"
